{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.3"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-013",
    "title": "镇中借宿"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_070",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "“交给一个没有名字的人。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "无灯镇没有城门。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1897,
          "end": 1897
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "石碑之后，屋舍沿一条弯曲的土路散开。路边没有灯柱，没有灯笼，连屋檐下常见的火盆也被泥盖住。雨水从瓦缝间落下，镇子里的人却走得很快，像是害怕在空地上停留太久。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1899,
          "end": 1899
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "白发老妇拄着木杖，领他们进了一间低矮的客舍。客舍只有两间房，墙上挂着一幅褪色的山水画，画中唯一的灯被人用黑墨涂去。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1901,
          "end": 1901
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“一间房，两张床。”老妇说，“入夜不点灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1903,
          "end": 1903
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我们要找三个人。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1905,
          "end": 1905
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老妇将热水放在桌上：“三个人叫什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1907,
          "end": 1907
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离在桌下轻轻踢了他一下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1909,
          "end": 1909
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临改口：“三名从玄霄宗来的引灯人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1911,
          "end": 1911
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老妇的手停在半空。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1913,
          "end": 1913
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这里不收引灯人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1915,
          "end": 1915
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三年前呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1917,
          "end": 1917
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三年前也不收。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1919,
          "end": 1919
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她转身要走，陆照临看见她腰间挂着一块旧木牌。木牌上刻着半盏灯，缺口处嵌着灰白石屑。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1921,
          "end": 1921
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这块牌子从哪里来的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1923,
          "end": 1923
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老妇低头看了看：“捡的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1925,
          "end": 1925
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“在哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1927,
          "end": 1927
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“井边。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1929,
          "end": 1929
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“镇里有井？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1931,
          "end": 1931
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老妇没有回答，端起空碗离开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1933,
          "end": 1933
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离走到窗边，掀开一角帘子。街上有五六个人站在屋檐下，彼此之间不说话，只用眼神交换消息。一个穿蓝布衣的中年人抬头看见他们，立即关上门。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1935,
          "end": 1935
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“镇民认识引灯人。”顾长离说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1937,
          "end": 1937
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们也认识那口井。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1939,
          "end": 1939
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“先别去找。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1941,
          "end": 1941
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1943,
          "end": 1943
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“老妇说入夜不点灯。现在还没入夜，她却不肯提井，说明有人在白天也盯着。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1945,
          "end": 1945
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把无灯镇的石碑规矩写在纸上：入夜不点灯，问路不问名，见到引路人，不要跟随。写到第三条时，掌心残印传来一阵凉意。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1947,
          "end": 1947
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门外传来脚步声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1949,
          "end": 1949
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一个十岁左右的男孩抱着空篮子站在门口。他的左耳缺了一小块，像被火燎过。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1951,
          "end": 1951
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们从山上来？”他问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1953,
          "end": 1953
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你叫什么？”陆照临下意识开口。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1955,
          "end": 1955
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "男孩立刻后退。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1957,
          "end": 1957
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离挡住陆照临：“别问名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1959,
          "end": 1959
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "男孩盯着他们手里的小灯：“那盏灯是谁给的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1961,
          "end": 1961
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“一个朋友。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1963,
          "end": 1963
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“朋友会点灯吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1965,
          "end": 1965
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他说不要点。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1967,
          "end": 1967
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "男孩点点头：“那就对了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1969,
          "end": 1969
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他把篮子放到门边，篮底压着一张湿纸。纸上画着一座井，井边站着三个没有脸的人。三个身影之间，连着一条弯曲的青线。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1971,
          "end": 1971
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁画的？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1973,
          "end": 1973
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "男孩指了指街对面：“画的人已经不在了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1975,
          "end": 1975
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不该问。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2001,
          "end": 2001
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三年前，有三个人来到这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2003,
          "end": 2003
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老妇抬头看向墙上那幅山水画：“他们不是三个人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2005,
          "end": 2005
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“是什么意思？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2007,
          "end": 2007
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们来的时候是三个人，走的时候只剩一盏灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2009,
          "end": 2009
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "屋外忽然响起敲门声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2011,
          "end": 2011
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2013,
          "end": 2013
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "两下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2015,
          "end": 2015
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第三下没有落在门上，而是落在屋内墙壁。墙上的山水画轻轻震动，画中被涂黑的灯竟渗出一圈青白色水痕。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2017,
          "end": 2017
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老妇脸色惨白：“别开门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2019,
          "end": 2019
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“门外是谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2021,
          "end": 2021
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“引路人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2023,
          "end": 2023
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是说见到引路人不要跟随吗？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2025,
          "end": 2025
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“规矩只管活人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-066",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2027,
          "end": 2027
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门外传来一个低沉的声音：“陆沉舟，第三盏灯送到了吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-067",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2029,
          "end": 2029
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临全身一震。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-068",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2031,
          "end": 2031
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "那声音和废井里的回响不同，更像一个真正站在门外的人。顾长离按住他的肩，示意他不要回答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-069",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2033,
          "end": 2033
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆沉舟不在这里。”她说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-070",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2035,
          "end": 2035
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门外沉默了片刻。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-071",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2037,
          "end": 2037
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就把灯交出来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-072",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2039,
          "end": 2039
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "小灯盏在陆照临怀中自行震动，灯罩内浮出一行雾字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-073",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2041,
          "end": 2041
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不要跟随。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-074",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2043,
          "end": 2043
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门缝下伸进一只湿透的手。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-075",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2045,
          "end": 2045
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "手腕上缠着黑色铜丝，指尖却没有指甲。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-076",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2047,
          "end": 2047
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它走了。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-078",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2051,
          "end": 2051
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "像潮水。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-101",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2098,
          "end": 2098
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三年前，也有三个人住在这里。”妇人说，“他们带着一盏灯，灯里没有火。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2196,
          "end": 2196
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临问：“他们去了哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2198,
          "end": 2198
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "妇人的手指抚过烧痕：“第一个说要去井边，第二个说要回山上，第三个什么也没说。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2200,
          "end": 2200
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你记得他们的名字吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2202,
          "end": 2202
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记得姓。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2204,
          "end": 2204
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“姓什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2206,
          "end": 2206
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“一个姓陆，一个姓顾，还有一个姓叶。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2208,
          "end": 2208
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离的脸色骤然发白。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2210,
          "end": 2210
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏旁支？”她问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2212,
          "end": 2212
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "妇人摇头：“我不认识顾氏。我只知道那个姓顾的人，临走前把一枚铜环交给了镇里的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2214,
          "end": 2214
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“交给谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2216,
          "end": 2216
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“交给一个没有名字的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 2218,
          "end": 2218
        }
      }
    ],
